{"obsah":"<p>This year's last men's camp is behind us. Autumn is slowly taking its toll on attendance, and of course these dates aren't as popular. Moreover, we aimed this camp at more experienced riders. Besides the traditional morning in the park on the jumps, pump track and skills centre, we included a slightly sharper part on natural obstacles and trails. </p>\n\n<p>The transfer was combined with a restaurant visit, and after a bit of a rest we set off for some proper rocks. The guys dropped like their lives depended on it (sometimes literally), but you could see progress towards more confidence. Hopefully everyone moved forward, gained more confidence and, we hope, motivation for the heap of things still to learn. For us the main thing in autumn was the experience and a bit of practice in patching tyres and cursing the sealant :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F10%2FIMG_3388.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F10%2FIMG_3388.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"194316\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F10%2FIMG_3388.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=194316\" class=\"wp-image-194316\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F10%2FIMG_3389.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F10%2FIMG_3389.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"194317\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googl